<title>AUSTRIA: SOCCER-AUSTRIAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONS/RUNNERS-UP SINCE 1946.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUSTRIAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONS/RUNNERS-UP SINCE 1946.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian league title winners and runners-up since 1946:</p>
<p>	   Champions		Runners-up</p>
<p> 1945-46 Rapid Vienna	   Austria Vienna</p>
<p> 1946-47 Wacker Vienna	  Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1947-48 Rapid Vienna	   Wacker Vienna</p>
<p> 1948-49 Austria Vienna	 Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1949-50 Austria Vienna	 Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1950-51 Rapid Vienna	   Wacker Vienna</p>
<p> 1951-52 Rapid Vienna	   Austria Vienna</p>
<p> 1952-53 Austria Vienna	 Wacker Vienna</p>
<p> 1953-54 Rapid Vienna	   Austria Vienna</p>
<p> 1954-55 Vienna FC		Vienna Sportclub</p>
<p> 1955-56 Rapid Vienna	   Wacker Vienna</p>
<p> 1956-57 Rapid Vienna	   Vienna FC</p>
<p> 1957-58 Vienna Sportclub     Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1958-59 Vienna Sportclub     Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1959-60 Rapid Vienna	   Vienna Sportclub</p>
<p> 1960-61 Austria Vienna	 Vienna FC</p>
<p> 1961-62 Austria Vienna	 Linzer ASK</p>
<p> 1962-63 Austria Vienna	 Admira</p>
<p> 1963-64 Rapid Vienna	   Austria Vienna</p>
<p> 1964-65 Linzer ASK	     Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1965-66 Admira		   Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1966-67 Rapid Vienna	   Wacker Innsbruck</p>
<p> 1967-68 Rapid Vienna	   Wacker Innsbruck</p>
<p> 1968-69 Austria Vienna	 Vienna Sportclub</p>
<p> 1969-70 Austria Vienna	 Vienna Sportclub</p>
<p> 1970-71 Wacker Innsbruck     SV Salzburg</p>
<p> 1971-72 Wacker Innsbruck     Austria Vienna</p>
<p> 1972-73 Wacker Innsbruck     Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1973-74 FC Linz		  Wacker Innsbruck</p>
<p> 1974-75 Wacker Innsbruck     FC Linz</p>
<p> 1975-76 Austria Vienna	 Wacker Innsbruck</p>
<p> 1976-77 Wacker Innsbruck     Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1977-78 Austria Vienna	 Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1978-79 Austria Vienna	 Vienna Sportclub</p>
<p> 1979-80 Austria Vienna	 FC Linz</p>
<p> 1980-81 Austria Vienna	 Sturm Graz</p>
<p> 1981-82 Rapid Vienna	   Austria Vienna</p>
<p> 1982-83 Rapid Vienna	   Austria Vienna</p>
<p> 1983-84 Austria Vienna	 Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1984-85 Austria Vienna	 Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1985-86 Austria Vienna	 Rapid Vienna</p>
<p> 1986-87 Rapid Vienna	   Austria Vienna</p>
<p> 1987-88 Rapid Vienna	   Austria Vienna</p>
<p> 1988-89 FC Tirol		 Admira/Wacker</p>
<p> 1989-90 FC Tirol		 Austria Vienna</p>
<p> 1990-91 Austria Vienna	 FC Tirol</p>
<p> 1991-92 Austria Vienna	 SV Salzburg</p>
<p> 1992-93 Austria Vienna	 SV Salzburg</p>
<p> 1993-94 SV Salzburg	    Austria Vienna</p>
<p> 1994-95 SV Salzburg	    Sturm Graz</p>
<p> 1995-96 Rapid Vienna	   Sturm Graz</p>
<p> 1996-97 SV Salsburg	    Rapid Vienna</p>
<p>Since the league began in 1911 the following clubs have won the title:</p>
<p>30 - Rapid Vienna</p>
<p>21 - Austria Vienna</p>
<p>9 - Admira/Wacker</p>
<p>(also called Wacker Vienna and Admira)</p>
<p>7 - FC Tirol Innsbruck</p>
<p>(also called Wacker Innsbruck and FC Tirol)</p>
<p>6 - Vienna FC</p>
<p>3 - Vienna Sportclub</p>
<p>3 - SV Salzburg</p>
<p>1 - WAC, Linzer ASK, WAF, FC Linz, FAC, SC Hakoah</p>
